---
// Hero - Monografia arquitetônica com identidade e acesso direto aos lançamentos recentes
---

<section id="hero" class="relative border-b border-[#D4D5CF]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 border-x border-[#D4D5CF]">

      <!-- Coluna Principal (Esquerda) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-14 flex flex-col justify-between border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-[#D4D5CF]">
        <div>
          <h1 class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-[4.25rem] text-[#111214] tracking-[-0.035em] leading-[1.02] max-w-3xl text-balance">
            Software nativo, sistemas em Rust e computação formal.
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#4B4F58] max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
            Sou <strong class="text-[#111214] font-semibold">José Vitor Diniz Miranda</strong>, graduando em Ciência da Computação pela UFCG. Projeto e construo aplicações Android em Kotlin e Jetpack Compose, ferramentas de sistema para Linux e simuladores formais.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3.5">
            <a
              href="#projetos"
              class="px-6 py-3.5 bg-[#111214] hover:bg-[#2B35AF] text-[#F4F4F0] text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2.5"
            >
              <span>Explorar projetos</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M8 3v10M4 9l4 4 4-4" stroke-linecap="square" />
              </svg>
            </a>

            <a
              href="https://github.com/vimi-tt"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="px-6 py-3.5 border border-[#111214] hover:bg-[#111214] hover:text-[#F4F4F0] text-[#111214] text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2"
            >
              <span>GitHub @vimi-tt</span>
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4.5 11.5L11.5 4.5M6 4.5h5.5V10" stroke-linecap="square" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Faixa inferior: Projetos recentes em destaque -->
        <div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-[#D4D5CF] grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <a href="#projeto-overview" class="group p-4 bg-[#ECECE6]/70 hover:bg-[#131418] hover:text-[#F4F4F0] border border-[#D4D5CF] hover:border-[#131418] transition-colors flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <div>
              <div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#2B35AF] group-hover:text-[#A4A8B3]">
                Kotlin · Android 12+
              </div>
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight mt-0.5">
                Overview
              </div>
            </div>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-[#4B4F58] group-hover:text-[#F4F4F0] transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" stroke-linecap="square" />
            </svg>
          </a>

          <a href="#projeto-verso" class="group p-4 bg-[#ECECE6]/70 hover:bg-[#131418] hover:text-[#F4F4F0] border border-[#D4D5CF] hover:border-[#131418] transition-colors flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <div>
              <div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#2B35AF] group-hover:text-[#A4A8B3]">
                Kotlin · Compose
              </div>
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight mt-0.5">
                Verso
              </div>
            </div>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-[#4B4F58] group-hover:text-[#F4F4F0] transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" stroke-linecap="square" />
            </svg>
          </a>

          <a href="#projeto-flicker" class="group p-4 bg-[#ECECE6]/70 hover:bg-[#131418] hover:text-[#F4F4F0] border border-[#D4D5CF] hover:border-[#131418] transition-colors flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <div>
              <div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#2B35AF] group-hover:text-[#A4A8B3]">
                Rust · Linux
              </div>
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight mt-0.5">
                Flicker
              </div>
            </div>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-[#4B4F58] group-hover:text-[#F4F4F0] transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" stroke-linecap="square" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Coluna de Identidade (Direita) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 p-6 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between bg-[#ECECE6]/45">
        <div class="border border-[#D4D5CF] bg-[#F4F4F0] p-3">
          <div class="aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#131418] text-[#F4F4F0]">
            <img
              src="/avatar.png"
              alt="Retrato de José Vitor Diniz Miranda"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale contrast-115 hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500"
              loading="eager"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <dl class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm border-t border-[#D4D5CF] pt-5">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="text-[#6C707A] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Handle</dt>
            <dd class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-[#111214]">@vimi-tt</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="text-[#6C707A] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Formação</dt>
            <dd class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#111214] text-right">Ciência da Computação · UFCG</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="text-[#6C707A] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Base</dt>
            <dd class="text-xs font-medium text-[#4B4F58] text-right">Campina Grande, PB</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="text-[#6C707A] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Foco</dt>
            <dd class="font-mono text-xs font-medium text-[#2B35AF] text-right">Kotlin · Rust · Haskell</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
